[SIZE=5][COLOR=#FF6600][B]🎃 Halloween Plugin v3.0.3 - Double Hotfix Update![/B][/COLOR][/SIZE]

[COLOR=#FF6600][B]Release Date:[/B][/COLOR] October 15, 2025
[COLOR=#FF6600][B]Build:[/B][/COLOR] Two critical hotfixes (v3.0.2 + v3.0.3)

[SIZE=4][COLOR=#CC3300]🐛 Critical Bug Fixes[/COLOR][/SIZE]

[COLOR=#009900][B]v3.0.3 - Reward System Hotfix[/B][/COLOR]
[LIST]
[*][B]FIXED:[/B] Min/max 0,0 configuration errors when disabling rewards
[*][B]FIXED:[/B] Random pumpkin mob drops respect [FONT=courier]min: 0, max: 0[/FONT] setting  
[*][B]FIXED:[/B] Bat transformation pumpkin rewards respect [FONT=courier]min: 0, max: 0[/FONT] setting
[*][B]IMPROVED:[/B] Admins can safely disable specific rewards without plugin errors
[/LIST]

[COLOR=#009900][B]v3.0.2 - Pumpkin Trader Hotfix[/B][/COLOR]
[LIST]
[*][B]FIXED:[/B] Pumpkin Trader creation bypassing Halloween enable/disable settings
[*][B]FIXED:[/B] Players with Halloween disabled can no longer create Pumpkin Traders
[*][B]FIXED:[/B] Pumpkin Trader creation respects global Halloween on/off state
[/LIST]

[SIZE=4][COLOR=#6600CC]💡 What This Means for Admins[/COLOR][/SIZE]

[COLOR=#0066CC][B]Better Control Over Rewards:[/B][/COLOR]
You can now safely disable specific rewards by setting [FONT=courier]min: 0, max: 0[/FONT]:

[CODE]
# Disable random pumpkin drops from mobs with pumpkin heads
random_pumpkin_mobs:
  pumpkin_drops: 
    min: 0
    max: 0

# Disable pumpkin rewards from bat transformations (keep XP and potions)
bat_transformation:
  rewards:
    pumpkins_min: 0
    pumpkins_max: 0
    potion_drop: true  # Still gives potions
[/CODE]

[COLOR=#0066CC][B]Proper Halloween Disable Respect:[/B][/COLOR]
All features now properly respect your Halloween settings:
[LIST]
[*][FONT=courier]/halloween off[/FONT] - Globally disables all Halloween features
[*][FONT=courier]/halloween disable[/FONT] - Individual players can opt out
[*]Pumpkin Trader creation now respects these settings
[/LIST]

[SIZE=4][COLOR=#FF6600]📦 Installation[/COLOR][/SIZE]

[LIST=1]
[*]Stop your server
[*]Replace [FONT=courier]halloween-plugin-3.0.1.jar[/FONT] with [FONT=courier]halloween-plugin-3.0.3.jar[/FONT]
[*]Start your server
[*]No config changes needed - hotfix automatically compatible
[/LIST]

[COLOR=#CC6600][B]Compatibility:[/B][/COLOR] Works with existing v3.0.0, v3.0.1, v3.0.2 configs
[COLOR=#CC6600][B]Minecraft:[/B][/COLOR] 1.21.1+ (Paper/Purpur recommended)
[COLOR=#CC6600][B]Java:[/B][/COLOR] 17+

